%I A401878 #6 Nov 15 2026 21:35:05
%S A401878 3,10,15,27,29,36,46,51,53,57,63,86,90,99,101,105,111,113,119,123,125,
%T A401878 136,156,166,170,178,190,195,197,201,207,209,215,219,221,225,231,235,
%U A401878 237,243,245,249,255,300,308,326,330,338,350,354,366,374,378,387,389
%N A401878 Numbers k such that the k-th composition in standard order has an even number of parts, the first and last of which are equal.
%C A401878 It is not clear if 1 should be included.
%C A401878 The k-th composition in standard order (graded reverse-lexicographic, A066099) is obtained by taking the set of positions of 1's in the reversed binary expansion of k, prepending 0, taking first differences, and reversing again. This gives a bijective correspondence between nonnegative integers and integer compositions.
%F A401878 A400764 = A401878 \/ A401877.
%e A401878 The terms together with their standard compositions begin:
%e A401878     3: (1,1)
%e A401878    10: (2,2)
%e A401878    15: (1,1,1,1)
%e A401878    27: (1,2,1,1)
%e A401878    29: (1,1,2,1)
%e A401878    36: (3,3)
%e A401878    46: (2,1,1,2)
%e A401878    51: (1,3,1,1)
%e A401878    53: (1,2,2,1)
%e A401878    57: (1,1,3,1)
%e A401878    63: (1,1,1,1,1,1)
%e A401878    86: (2,2,1,2)
%e A401878    90: (2,1,2,2)
%e A401878    99: (1,4,1,1)
%e A401878   101: (1,3,2,1)
%e A401878   105: (1,2,3,1)
%e A401878   111: (1,2,1,1,1,1)
%e A401878   113: (1,1,4,1)
%e A401878   119: (1,1,2,1,1,1)
%e A401878   123: (1,1,1,2,1,1)
%t A401878 stc[n_]:=Differences[Prepend[Join @@ Position[Reverse[IntegerDigits[n,2]],1],0]]//Reverse;
%t A401878 Select[Range[100],EvenQ[Length[stc[#]]] && First[stc[#]]==Last[stc[#]]&]
%Y A401878 These compositions are counted by A078008.
%Y A401878 Allowing any length gives A400764, counted by A128209 (shifted).
%Y A401878 For full palindrome compositions we have A400765, odd A400766.
%Y A401878 For odd instead of even we have A401877, counted by A128209.
%Y A401878 A001969 ranks even-length compositions, counted by A034008
%Y A401878 A066099 lists compositions in standard order.
%Y A401878 A077957 counts palindrome compositions.
%Y A401878 A098124 counts compositions with max part = length, ranks A389532.
%Y A401878 A400763 ranks palindromes summing to n, counted by A016116.
%Y A401878 Cf. A000700, A001045, A006995, A027357, A029837, A091065, A124767, A264619, A389530.
